            <div id="dx_partial">
                <p>Starting tag (should be II - Big Indian): II<br/>Version: 2A<br/><h2>File signature analysis (Header analysis)</h2>TIF file (Starts with 0x49 0x49)<BR/><h2>Additional scanning signature analysis</h2><p>Possible: [TIF files, sig: 4949] Count: 1<BR/>Possible: [JPEG files, sig: FFD8FF] Count: 1<BR/>Possible: [JPEG files, sig: 4A464946] Count: 1<BR/>Possible: [ICO file, sig: 00000100] Count: 30<BR/>Possible: [TIF graphics, sig: 4949] Count: 1<BR/></p><h2>File hex characters</h2><pre>[00000000] 49 49 2A 00 08 00 00 00 13 00 FE 00 04 00 01 00   II*.............<BR/>[00000016] 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 03 00 01 00 00 00 80 02   ................<BR/>[00000032] 00 00 01 01 03 00 01 00 00 00 61 04 00 00 02 01   ..........a.....<BR/>[00000048] 03 00 03 00 00 00 F2 00 00 00 03 01 03 00 01 00   ................<BR/>[00000064] 00 00 01 00 00 00 06 01 03 00 01 00 00 00 02 00   ................<BR/>[00000080] 00 00 11 01 04 00 01 00 00 00 1A 26 00 00 15 01   ...........&amp;....<BR/>[00000096] 03 00 01 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 16 01 03 00 01 00   ................<BR/>[00000112] 00 00 61 04 00 00 17 01 04 00 01 00 00 00 80 D7   ..a.............<BR/>[00000128] 20 00 1A 01 05 00 01 00 00 00 F8 00 00 00 1B 01   ................<BR/>[00000144] 05 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 1C 01 03 00 01 00   ................<BR/>[00000160] 00 00 01 00 00 00 28 01 03 00 01 00 00 00 02 00   ......(.........<BR/>[00000176] 00 00 31 01 02 00 1D 00 00 00 08 01 00 00 32 01   ..1...........2.<BR/>[00000192] 02 00 14 00 00 00 26 01 00 00 BC 02 01 00 AC 13   ......&amp;.........<BR/>[00000208] 00 00 3A 01 00 00 49 86 01 00 34 11 00 00 E6 14   ..:...I...4.....<BR/>[00000224] 00 00 69 87 04 00 01 00 00 00 9C FD 20 00 00 00   ..i.............<BR/>[00000240] 00 00 08 00 08 00 08 00 C0 C6 2D 00 10 27 00 00   ..........-..'..<BR/>[00000256] C0 C6 2D 00 10 27 00 00 41 64 6F 62 65 20 50 68   ..-..'..Adobe.Ph<BR/>[00000272] 6F 74 6F 73 68 6F 70 20 45 6C 65 6D 65 6E 74 73   otoshop.Elements<BR/>[00000288] 20